<title>NETHERLANDS: ALANHERI 1996 PROFIT DFL 1.51 MILLION.</title>
<headline>ALANHERI 1996 PROFIT DFL 1.51 MILLION.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit per share (gldrs) 2.25   vs    0.39</p>
<p>    Net profit			 1.51   vs    0.26</p>
<p>    Turnover			 273	vs  513</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 2.84   vs    2.99</p>
<p>    Extraordinary charge	   nil    vs    1.69</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)	    1.00   vs  nil</p>
<p>Note - Agricultural products trader Alanheri NV said it</p>
<p>expected a rise in net profits in 1997.</p>
</text>
